                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "GhXMa",
                      "fill": "$color-text-muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Whether you are aiming for the prestigious Super Randonneur title or just looking to explore the Belarusian countryside at your own pace, our peloton is open to you. There are no limits—only the ones you set for yourself. We look forward to seeing you at the start line!",
